@SystemDesignRecommenderApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5220

### Health Check - Verify Ollama Chat API is running
GET {{SystemDesignRecommenderApi_HostAddress}}/ollamachat
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Available Models - List all models installed in Ollama
GET {{SystemDesignRecommenderApi_HostAddress}}/ollamachat/models
Accept: application/json

###

### Chat with Ollama - Basic request with default model (llama3:8b)
POST {{SystemDesignRecommenderApi_HostAddress}}/ollamachat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What is system design?"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Chat with Ollama - With custom model and temperature
POST {{SystemDesignRecommenderApi_HostAddress}}/ollamachat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a helpful system design expert."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Explain the CAP theorem"
    }
  ],
  "model": "llama3:8b",
  "temperature": 0.5
}

###

### Chat with Ollama - Multi-turn conversation
POST {{SystemDesignRecommenderApi_HostAddress}}/ollamachat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What is microservices architecture?"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Microservices architecture is a method of developing software systems that try to focus on building single-function modules with well-defined interfaces and operations."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What are the advantages of microservices?"
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.7
}
